@inject Microsoft.AspNetCore.Antiforgery.IAntiforgery Antiforgery
@{
    // Bemanning — the day-of functionary roster (StaffAssignment). Discipline-aware role groups from
    // the server; one "Lägg till funktionär" dialog (also reachable per role group). Person = member
    // search (autofills name/phone) or free text. Shifts, target ranges, responsible, status, and the
    // Tävlingsledning app-access mirror all live here. See COMPETITION_STAFFING_SYSTEM.md §6.
    //
    // The tab is split into four focused sub-views, ordered by the question the organiser is asking —
    // NOT by which table the data happens to live in (that was the old split, and it made the same person
    // look different depending on which tab you were standing on):
    //   1. Personer        — WHO is involved and what does each of them do (the people layer, default view).
    //                        Roster rows + self-sign-ups + availability + prep ownership on ONE row per human.
    //   2. Roller          — the same people grouped BY ROLE ("who is on skjutlag 3") — a projection, not a
    //                        second source of truth.
    //   3. Behov & täckning — arbetspass (skift), bemanningsbehov, coverage grid.
    //   4. Värvning        — how to GET more people: sourcing scopes, mail-out, the /bemanna sign-up page.
    //                        Reviewing who signed up happens under Personer, where the roles are.
    var competitionId = ViewData["CompetitionId"];
    var stfToken = Antiforgery.GetAndStoreTokens(Context).RequestToken;
}

@* TODO: här kommer en länk till instruktionsfilmen. Den gamla "Så gör du"-raden är borttagen — den
   beskrev dessutom det gamla arbetssättet ("lägg upp skift"), som dagslistan har ersatt. *@

@*
    BEMANNING IS THE GRID. There are no sub-tabs.

    It used to be five: Rutnät / Personer / Roller / Behov & täckning / Värvning. An organiser opening
    Planering for the first time clicked "Bemanning" and was met by five more tabs with no way to tell
    which one was the work — and hiding them behind a menu would not have helped, because a menu of five
    is the same question ("which one?") with the buttons out of sight.

    So they were DISSOLVED rather than hidden. The other views were never places; they were answers to
    questions you get while standing in the grid, so they open from the grid:
      · Personer  → click a name. The person panel is a detail view, not a destination.
      · Roller    → deleted. The grid answers "who has role X", with a day axis and a club column.
      · Behov     → the needed-vs-filled number lives in the cell, where the hole already is.
      · Värvning  → a button. It is genuinely a different job (get people, not place them).
    The one thing the grid cannot show is people who are NOT in it — volunteers with no assignment yet —
    so those get a strip above it, visible only when there are any.
*@
<div id="bemSubContent">

    <div id="bem-rutnat">
        @await Html.PartialAsync("_StaffingGrid", ViewData)
    </div>

    @*
        ---- Personer — the people layer, now an offcanvas opened from a name in the grid ----
        One row per human, whatever store they came from: a roster assignment, a self-sign-up on /bemanna,
        a declared availability window, or ownership of preparation work.
        Kept as a full list too (the "Alla personer" item in Mer), because the volunteer queue and the
        who-hasn't-answered view are about people the grid cannot show.
    *@
    @*
        TWO MODES, one panel. Clicking a name in the grid opens ONE PERSON — a card, not the list filtered
        down to a single row. The first cut did the latter and it was unreadable: a search box, three
        filters, "Visar 1 av 41", five column headings and the same assignment printed twice, all to show
        one human. A list view and a detail view are different objects and must look like it.
    *@
    <div class="offcanvas offcanvas-end" tabindex="-1" id="bemPersonerPanel" style="width:min(720px,95vw)">
      <div class="offcanvas-header border-bottom">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 min-w-0">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="stfBackBtn"
                    style="display:none" onclick="stfBackToList()" title="Tillbaka till listan">
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i>
            </button>
            <h5 class="offcanvas-title text-truncate" id="stfPanelTitle"><i class="bi bi-people-fill me-2"></i>Personer</h5>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="offcanvas"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="offcanvas-body">
        <div id="stfPersonMode" style="display:none"></div>
        <div id="stfListMode">
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2">
            <div class="small" id="stfPeopleSummary"></div>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="stfOpenAdd('')">
                <i class="bi bi-person-plus me-1"></i>Lägg till funktionär
            </button>
        </div>

        @* The volunteer queue: the one action this tab exists to make obvious. Hidden when empty. *@
        <div id="stfQueueBanner" class="mb-3"></div>

        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-2" id="stfPplFilterBar">
            <div class="position-relative flex-grow-1" style="min-width:170px;max-width:280px">
                <i class="bi bi-search position-absolute text-muted" style="left:.65rem;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%)"></i>
                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm ps-4" id="stfPplFilter" placeholder="Sök namn, roll, klubb…" autocomplete="off">
            </div>
            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="stfPplView" style="width:auto" title="Vilka personer som visas">
                <option value="">Alla personer</option>
                <option value="queue">Att tilldela (anmälda utan uppdrag)</option>
                <option value="assigned">Har uppdrag</option>
                <option value="invited">Väntar på svar</option>
                <option value="declined">Har avböjt</option>
                <option value="prep">Förberedelseansvariga</option>
                <option value="external">Externa hjälpare</option>
            </select>
            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="stfPplRole" style="width:auto"><option value="">Alla roller</option></select>
            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="stfPplPass" style="width:auto"><option value="">Alla skift</option></select>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="stfPplClear" onclick="stfPplClearFilter()" style="display:none"><i class="bi bi-x-lg me-1"></i>Rensa</button>
            <span class="text-muted small ms-auto" id="stfPplCount"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="table-responsive border rounded" style="max-height:70vh;overflow:auto">
            <table class="table table-sm table-hover align-middle mb-0" id="stfPeopleTable">
                <thead class="table-light" style="position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2">
                    <tr>
                        <th style="min-width:180px">Person</th>
                        <th style="min-width:220px">Uppdrag på tävlingen</th>
                        <th style="min-width:120px">Tid</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width:110px" title="Uppgifter i Förberedelser">Förb.</th>
                        <th style="width:120px">Status</th>
                        <th class="text-end" style="width:150px"></th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="stfPeopleBody">
                    <tr><td colspan="6" class="text-center text-muted py-4"><div class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm" role="status"></div> Laddar…</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2" id="stfPeopleMore"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    @*
        ---- Koppla personer till medlemmar ----
        A staffing plan is typed from paper, so most people start as free text — 32 of 41 on the SM plan.
        A free-text row delivers nothing: no personal schedule, no push, no club tally. Linking them one at
        a time is 32 searches and will not happen, so we guess and let the organiser confirm a screenful.
        Nothing is ever linked without a click: binding "Tommy" to the wrong Tommy would hand a stranger
        someone else's shift, and would be invisible afterwards.
    *@
    <div class="offcanvas offcanvas-end" tabindex="-1" id="bemMatchPanel" style="width:min(860px,96vw)">
      <div class="offcanvas-header border-bottom">
        <div>
          <h5 class="offcanvas-title mb-0"><i class="bi bi-person-check me-2"></i>Koppla personer till medlemmar</h5>
          <div class="small text-muted" id="stfMatchSummary"></div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="offcanvas"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="offcanvas-body">
        <p class="text-muted small">
            Personer som skrivits in för hand får varken personligt schema eller notiser, och räknas inte
            till klubbens funktionärer. Här gissar vi vem som menades — <strong>du bekräftar</strong>.
            En koppling ändrar <em>alla</em> personens uppdrag på tävlingen.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex gap-2 mb-3 flex-wrap">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" id="stfMatchAllBtn" onclick="stfLinkAllConfident()">
                <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge me-1"></i>Koppla alla säkra
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" onclick="stfLoadMatches()">
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise me-1"></i>Läs om
            </button>
        </div>
        <div id="stfMatchList"><div class="text-muted small">Laddar…</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    @*
        ---- Roller — RETIRED as a destination ----
        The grid answers "who has role X" with a day axis and a club column, so a second role-grouped list
        was a second place to edit the same rows. The markup stays here, permanently hidden, because a
        dozen helper functions and the add/edit dialog still bind to its ids; loadRoster() early-returns
        while it is hidden, so it costs nothing. Delete the pane and those bindings together, not before.
    *@
    <div id="bem-roster" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
            <div>
                <span class="text-muted small" id="stfCount"></span>
                <div class="small mt-1" id="stfCovSummary"></div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="stfOpenAdd('')">
                <i class="bi bi-person-plus me-1"></i>Lägg till funktionär
            </button>
        </div>

        @*
            Schemakvalitet — what the funktionärer will actually SEE in their personal schedule
            (/mitt-schema), surfaced here while it's still cheap to fix:
              • assignments with no shift and no pass render as "Heldag" for the person, which is a
                thin answer to "when should I be there";
              • two overlapping shifts for the same person is a clash that's far cheaper to catch now
                than on the morning of the competition.
            Hidden entirely when there's nothing to report.
        *@
        <div id="stfQuality" class="mb-3"></div>

        @* Filter/search toolbar — keeps the roster usable when there are 100+ funktionärer. *@
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-3" id="stfFilterBar">
            <div class="position-relative flex-grow-1" style="min-width:170px;max-width:280px">
                <i class="bi bi-search position-absolute text-muted" style="left:.65rem;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%)"></i>
                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm ps-4" id="stfFilter" placeholder="Sök namn, roll, plats…" autocomplete="off">
            </div>
            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="stfFilterRole" style="width:auto"><option value="">Alla roller</option></select>
            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="stfFilterPass" style="width:auto"><option value="">Alla skift</option></select>
            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="stfFilterStatus" style="width:auto">
                <option value="">Alla statusar</option>
                <option value="Planned">Planerad</option>
                <option value="Invited">Inbjuden</option>
                <option value="Accepted">Accepterad</option>
                <option value="Declined">Avböjt</option>
                <option value="Confirmed">Bekräftad</option>
            </select>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="stfFilterClear" onclick="stfClearFilter()" style="display:none"><i class="bi bi-x-lg me-1"></i>Rensa</button>
            <span class="text-muted small ms-auto" id="stfFilterCount"></span>
            <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm" role="group" aria-label="Fäll ihop / visa alla">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" onclick="stfExpandAll(true)" title="Visa alla"><i class="bi bi-arrows-expand"></i></button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" onclick="stfExpandAll(false)" title="Fäll ihop alla"><i class="bi bi-arrows-collapse"></i></button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="stfRoster">
            <div class="text-center text-muted py-4"><div class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm" role="status"></div> Laddar…</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    @*
        ---- Skift & täckning — an offcanvas, opened from "Mer" ----
        The needed-vs-filled number now lives in the grid cell, where the hole already is. What is left
        here is the finer machinery: shifts inside a day, and the per-role need that feeds those numbers.
        It was a tab, and as a tab it stayed empty on every real competition — nobody found it.
    *@
    <div class="offcanvas offcanvas-end" tabindex="-1" id="bemBehovPanel" style="width:min(760px,95vw)">
      <div class="offcanvas-header border-bottom">
        <h5 class="offcanvas-title"><i class="bi bi-clipboard-data me-2"></i>Skift &amp; behov</h5>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="offcanvas"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="offcanvas-body">
        <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
            Dagarna sätter du i rutnätet. Här delar du en dag i <strong>skift</strong> om ni jobbar i
            omgångar, och anger <strong>hur många</strong> ni behöver per roll — siffran syns sedan
            direkt i rutnätets rutor.
        </p>
        <div class="card mb-3" id="stfPassCard">
            <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center py-2 flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="fw-semibold"><i class="bi bi-calendar2-week me-1"></i>Arbetspass (skift)</span>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" onclick="stfOpenPass(0)"><i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-1"></i>Lägg till skift</button>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body py-2">
                <div class="small text-muted mb-1">Ett skift = en tidsperiod som funktionärer bemannar. Koppla personer till ett skift i "Lägg till funktionär" så räknas de in i täckningen.</div>
                <div id="stfPassList" class="mb-2"><div class="text-muted small">Laddar…</div></div>
                <div id="stfNeedsEditor" class="mb-2"></div>
                <hr class="my-2">
                <div class="fw-semibold small mb-1"><i class="bi bi-grid-3x3-gap me-1"></i>Täckning (bemannat / behov)</div>
                <div id="stfCoverage"><div class="text-muted small">Laddar…</div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    @*
        ---- Värvning — an offcanvas behind one button ----
        Genuinely a different job: getting people, not placing them. Reviewing who signed up happens in the
        volunteer strip above the grid and in the person panel, with everyone else — a second person-list
        in here is exactly what once made a volunteer look "unassigned" after they had been given a role.
    *@
    <div class="offcanvas offcanvas-end" tabindex="-1" id="bemVarvningPanel" style="width:min(760px,95vw)">
      <div class="offcanvas-header border-bottom">
        <h5 class="offcanvas-title"><i class="bi bi-megaphone me-2"></i>Värva funktionärer</h5>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="offcanvas"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="offcanvas-body">
        <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
            Saknas funktionärer? Öppna tävlingen för självanmälan, skicka en förfrågan till klubben/kretsen,
            och lägg upp en <strong>anmälningssida</strong> där medlemmar bockar för de pass de kan hjälpa
            till med. De som anmäler sig dyker upp <strong>överst i rutnätet</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="card mb-3" id="stfSourceCard">
            <div class="card-body py-2" id="stfSourceBody"><div class="text-muted small">Laddar…</div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-3" id="stfHelpCard">
            <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center py-2 flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="fw-semibold"><i class="bi bi-hand-thumbs-up me-1"></i>Anmälningssida (självanmälan)</span>
                <span class="d-flex gap-1 flex-wrap">
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="stfPreviewBtn" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="bi bi-eye me-1"></i>Förhandsgranska</a>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" onclick="stfOpenSlot(0)"><i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-1"></i>Lägg till pass</button>
                </span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body py-2">
                <div class="text-muted small mb-2">Lägg upp de <strong>pass</strong> ni behöver hjälp med (datum, tid, rubrik, kort beskrivning — flera per datum går bra). Medlemmar bockar för de pass de kan hjälpa till med på sidan <code>/bemanna</code> och skriver en kommentar.</div>
                <div id="stfHelpSlots" class="mb-3"><div class="text-muted small">Laddar…</div></div>
                @* Just the tally + a way in — the volunteers themselves show above the grid. *@
                <div id="stfHelpTally"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
</div>

@* ============================ Modals (kept outside the tab panes) ============================ *@

<!-- Add/Edit funktionär modal -->
<div class="modal fade" id="stfModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title" id="stfModalTitle">Lägg till funktionär</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Stäng"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <input type="hidden" id="stfId" value="0">
                <input type="hidden" id="stfMemberId" value="0">

                @*
                    What this person ALREADY has on this competition. Shown as soon as a person is picked,
                    because the old dialog was blind to it: you could hand someone a third markörpass without
                    ever being told about the first two, or re-assign a volunteer you had already assigned.
                *@
                <div id="stfExisting" class="mb-3" style="display:none"></div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Person</label>
                    <div class="position-relative">
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stfMemberSearch" placeholder="Sök medlem (namn eller e-post)…" autocomplete="off">
                        <div id="stfMemberResults" class="list-group position-absolute w-100 shadow" style="z-index:1080; display:none; max-height:240px; overflow:auto;"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row g-2 mt-1">
                        <div class="col-sm-7">
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stfName" placeholder="Namn (eller extern hjälp utan konto)">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-5">
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stfPhone" placeholder="Telefon (valfritt)">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-text">Sök en medlem för att fylla i namn och telefon, eller skriv ett fritt namn för en extern hjälpare.</div>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-2">
                    <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Roll</label>
                        <select class="form-select" id="stfRole"></select>
                        <div class="form-text" id="stfRoleDesc"></div>
                        <div class="form-text mt-1" id="stfRoleNeeds"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6 mb-3" id="stfFunctionTitleWrap" style="display:none">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Funktion</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stfFunctionTitle" list="stfFunctionTitles" placeholder="t.ex. Tävlingsledare">
                        <datalist id="stfFunctionTitles">
                            <option value="Tävlingsledare"></option>
                            <option value="Bitr. tävlingsledare"></option>
                            <option value="Säkerhetschef"></option>
                            <option value="Sekreterare"></option>
                        </datalist>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-2">
                    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Var</label>
                        <select class="form-select" id="stfScopeType">
                            <option value="All">Hela tävlingen</option>
                            <option value="Skjutlag">Skjutlag</option>
                            <option value="Station">Station</option>
                            <option value="Klass">Klass</option>
                            <option value="Patrull">Patrull</option>
                            <option value="Bana">Bana</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3" id="stfScopeKeyWrap" style="display:none">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold" id="stfScopeKeyLabel">Nummer</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stfScopeKey" placeholder="t.ex. 2">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3" id="stfTargetWrap" style="display:none">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Tavlor (intervall)</label>
                        <div class="input-group">
                            <input type="number" min="1" class="form-control" id="stfTargetFrom" placeholder="från">
                            <span class="input-group-text">–</span>
                            <input type="number" min="1" class="form-control" id="stfTargetTo" placeholder="till">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-2">
                    <div class="col-12 mb-2">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Pass (skift)</label>
                        <select class="form-select" id="stfPass"><option value="">— inget pass —</option></select>
                        <div class="form-text">Välj ett pass så räknas personen in i täckningen. Eller ange egna tider nedan för heldag/avvikande tid.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-2">
                    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Pass — från</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stfStartsAt" placeholder="Heldag">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Pass — till</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stfEndsAt" placeholder="Heldag">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Status</label>
                        <select class="form-select" id="stfStatus">
                            <option value="Planned">Planerad</option>
                            <option value="Invited">Inbjuden</option>
                            <option value="Accepted">Accepterad</option>
                            <option value="Declined">Avböjt</option>
                            <option value="Confirmed">Bekräftad</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-text mb-3" style="margin-top:-.5rem">Lämna passtiderna tomma för heldag. Flera personer kan dela samma roll/plats på olika tider (avlösning).</div>

                <div class="form-check mb-2">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="stfResponsible">
                    <label class="form-check-label" for="stfResponsible">Ansvarig för rollen/området</label>
                </div>
                <div class="form-check mb-3" id="stfAdminAccessWrap">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="stfAdminAccess">
                    <label class="form-check-label" for="stfAdminAccess">
                        Ge behörighet att hantera tävlingen i pistol.nu
                    </label>
                    <div class="form-text" id="stfAdminAccessHelp">
                        Personen kommer åt tävlingens administration (anmälningar, startlistor, resultat och
                        funktionärssidorna). Behövs t.ex. för sekretariat, kassa och stationschefer — det gör
                        dem <strong>inte</strong> till tävlingsledare. Kräver att personen är vald som medlem ovan.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-1">
                    <label class="form-label fw-semibold">Anteckning</label>
                    <textarea class="form-control" id="stfNote" rows="2" placeholder="Valfritt"></textarea>
                </div>
